      "writtenOn": "2025-12-18T20:30:33Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This seems strange that this would override the user\u0027s explicit workaround the requests. The workarounds are all disabled by default already, so have a way to override that default for each workaround and the re-override it again is a bit odd?\n\nIf this is for the \"no workarounds mode\" then I would expect that to just be a Dawn toggle that we use to wrap the `options.workarounds.blah \u003d true;` lines on the Dawn side.",
      "revId": "5c8ac49e999946f5560e7ef876ff43cbdb24e52e",
      "serverId": "dd02978d-1a8e-36d7-bcc0-a5723e5c0abd"
    },
    {
