      "writtenOn": "2025-12-18T21:10:39Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I kinda like this nicer. Then dawn doesn\u0027t have to do anything, they just flip this flag and it overrides the settings. It could go either way, it just depends on where you put the if check, really.",
      "parentUuid": "a6cda906_6b0a4adf",
      "revId": "5c8ac49e999946f5560e7ef876ff43cbdb24e52e",
      "serverId": "dd02978d-1a8e-36d7-bcc0-a5723e5c0abd"
